[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12540.79, "timestamp": "03:29:00", "text": "如果你是直播用户。对，就是那个节日。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12543.03, "timestamp": "03:29:03", "text": "你在《Valerant》里是什么角色？我目前没有排名。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12546.87, "timestamp": "03:29:06", "text": "D 我不是排名者。我不打排位赛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12551.269, "timestamp": "03:29:11", "text": "就像你一样。而我没排名。而且是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12554.309, "timestamp": "03:29:14", "text": "是的。可怕的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12557.59, "timestamp": "03:29:17", "text": "视频里的声音，我是说噪音本身。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12559.349, "timestamp": "03:29:19", "text": "极好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12560.87, "timestamp": "03:29:20", "text": "感觉我已经很久没玩了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12563.19, "timestamp": "03:29:23", "text": "同时，也在观察末影人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12566.71, "timestamp": "03:29:26", "text": "还有噪音，是的，他们的声音"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12569.19, "timestamp": "03:29:29", "text": "或者不管它是什么，嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12573.349, "timestamp": "03:29:33", "text": "你擅长恐怖片吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12576.309, "timestamp": "03:29:36", "text": "你喜欢恐怖片吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12581.03, "timestamp": "03:29:41", "text": "什么恐怖？没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12582.95, "timestamp": "03:29:42", "text": "相同的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12585.75, "timestamp": "03:29:45", "text": "男人。最后，我终于找到了一个可以依靠的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12592.07, "timestamp": "03:29:52", "text": "我也不喜欢恐怖片。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12595.19, "timestamp": "03:29:55", "text": "我懂了。我的意思是，我差点疯了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12598.15, "timestamp": "03:29:58", "text": "甚至在 DDLC 中也是如此。"}]